        "en": "Compassionate and attentive clinical care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise the veterinary doctors and technicians for their gentle manner, clear explanations, and responsive care during appointments. Reviewers appreciate that the clinical team follows up attentively after surgeries and exams, though a few clients noted occasional rigidity regarding appointment scheduling policies."
      },
      "mentions": 37
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for nervous pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight how comfortable and relaxed their dogs and cats feel when visiting the clinic. The veterinary team takes extra time to welcome rescue animals with patience, reducing stress during vaccinations and checkups. Pet parents note that even anxious pets settle down quickly under their gentle supervision."
      },
      "mentions": 18
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "title": {
        "en": "Clean and modern clinic environment"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Visitors regularly comment on the calm, welcoming atmosphere and pristine cleanliness of the facility on Yonge Street. Cat owners particularly appreciate the peaceful waiting space, noting that the modern clinic layout helps make vet visits significantly less stressful for both pets and their owners."
      },
      "mentions": 11
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How does Juno Veterinary handle after-hours pet emergencies?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Juno provides after-hours virtual care and refers urgent in-person emergencies to the Veterinary Emergency Clinic and Central Toronto Veterinary Referral Clinic."
      },
      "basis": "website"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Do pet owners need to schedule appointments in advance?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients book wellness visits and surgical procedures in advance through Juno's mobile app or website to ensure dedicated care time."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is there an on-site pharmacy for medications and refills?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the clinic dispenses prescribed medications directly through an on-site pharmacy following an examination by a veterinarian."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How do clients describe the atmosphere for nervous cats and dogs?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently describe the Summerhill clinic as clean, calm, and quiet, which helps soothe anxious pets upon arrival."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    }
